  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/to7HiMZ.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Hk8PdBRsrp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/v73gwtt.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8sO8rsb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1810\" height=\"39\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模组为众多热门模组添加了 Tough as Nails 兼容性。对于希望充分发挥 Tough as Nails 潜力的整合包而言，本模组是绝佳选择。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在兼容性扩展方面，本模组已开发完毕。尽管本模组的未来规划十分宏大，例如将添加新方块与物品以更好地融合 Tough As Nails！&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8sO8rsb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1810\" height=\"39\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">示例</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rO7uWKo.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HlVsvZx.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8sO8rsb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1810\" height=\"39\"></span></p>\n<h3><strong>已支持模组列表</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/393/435/637588742363737916.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/588/295/637958240318838626.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/190/975/636857615673605328.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ice and Fire</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/14/212/635589178760357568.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twilight Forest</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/592/10/637963451569131291.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/prelaws-blocky-siege\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blocky Siege</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/619/238/638006117537882034.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deeper And Darker</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/396/11/637595005615179370.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/397/613/637598857629083481.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nether's Delight</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/563/332/637918405171749675.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/twilight-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twilight Delight</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/477/194/637771671789296797.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/816/783/638194171174203953.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/444/622/637699815276651872.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/artifacts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Artifacts</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8sO8rsb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1810\" height=\"39\"></p>",
